title: shady_man_start
tags: bar
---
A scarred man in a dark corner beckons you over. 'I have information... for a price.' #line:shady_man_start_00 #portrait:speaker_shady_man
-> Pay for Info (100 Scrap) <<if (credits() >= 100) and (credits() >= 100)>> #line:shady_man_start_01
    <<set_fact station_boarding_trial_meet_shady_contact true>>
    <<take_credits 100>>
    <<jump shady_man_info_revealed>>
<<if quest_active("quest_station_boarding_trial")>>
    -> Debrief Contact for Boarding Trial #line:shady_man_start_02 #quest
        <<set_fact station_boarding_trial_decode_tip true>>
        <<set_fact station_boarding_trial_meet_shady_contact true>>
        <<set_fact station_boarding_trial_decode_tip true>>
        <<jump shady_man_info_revealed>>
<<endif>>
-> Threaten Him #line:shady_man_start_03
    <<set_fact station_boarding_trial_meet_shady_contact true>>
    <<if roll(100) <= 50>>
    <<jump shady_man_info_revealed>>
    <<else>>
    <<jump shady_man_bar_fight>>
    <<endif>>
-> Walk Away #line:shady_man_start_04 #leave
    <<set_fact station_boarding_trial_meet_shady_contact true>>
    <<complete_beat beat_shady_man>>
    <<return>>
===

title: shady_man_info_revealed
tags: 
---
<<play_sfx cue_ui_success>>
'There's a hidden cache in the asteroid belt. Coordinates transmitted.' #line:shady_man_info_revealed_00
-> Thanks #line:shady_man_info_revealed_01
    <<reveal_clue rumor_hidden_cache>>
    <<complete_beat beat_shady_man>>
    <<return>>
<<if quest_active("quest_station_boarding_trial")>>
    -> Log Debrief to Boarding Trial #line:shady_man_info_revealed_02 #quest
        <<quest_log quest_station_boarding_trial legacy_1>>
        <<complete_beat beat_shady_man>>
        <<return>>
<<endif>>
===

title: shady_man_bar_fight
tags: 
---
He pulls a knife! Security intervenes before it escalates. #line:shady_man_bar_fight_00
-> Leave Quickly #line:shady_man_bar_fight_01 #leave
    <<complete_beat beat_shady_man>>
    <<return>>
